---
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
import entries from '../data/selected.json';
const topics=[['People','Lives & ideas'],['Places','Land & water'],['Living culture','Art & making'],['Food','Tables & traditions'],['Maritime connections','Journeys & exchange']];
---
<Shell>
 <div class="wrap">
 <section class="hero"><div><p class="eyebrow">A living encyclopedia of Odisha</p><h1>Rediscover Utkal.<br/><em>Reimagine Odisha.</em></h1><p class="lead">A place to know our land, listen to its people, and carry its stories forward.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/explore/">Begin exploring <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/about/">Why Utkal Project?</a></div><p class="hero-note">Rooted in heritage. Growing through knowledge.</p></div><figure class="hero-media"><img src="/assets/coast-illustration-v1.png" width="1536" height="1024" alt="Concept illustration of a sailboat on an Odisha-inspired coast, with palms, flowers and patterned waves." fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>LAND, WATER & THE JOURNEYS BETWEEN</span><span>AI-assisted concept illustration</span></figcaption></figure></section>
 <section class="store-teaser"><div><p class="eyebrow">From the photographic archive · February 2009</p><h2>Bhubaneswar’s <em class="highlight">painted streets.</em></h2><p>Hours on foot, a camera, and walls worth stopping for. Photographs by Ahimanikya Satapathy.</p></div><a class="button" href="/stories/bhubaneswar-fresco/">Explore the fresco gallery ↗</a></section><div class="intro-band"><p class="eyebrow">Many ways to belong</p><p>For those who call Odisha home. For those far from it.<br/>And for everyone discovering it for the first time.</p></div>
 <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Follow your curiosity</p><h2>There is more to discover.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/explore/">Explore the collection ↗</a></div><div class="topic-row">{topics.map(([name,desc],i)=><a class="topic" href={'/explore/?topic='+encodeURIComponent(name)}><span class="topic-number">0{i+1}</span><span class="topic-name">{name}</span><small>{desc}</small></a>)}</div></section>
 </div>
 <section class="feature"><div class="wrap feature-inner"><div class="sky-panel" aria-label="Decorative illustration of a star"><p style="color:var(--paper)">The sky above.<br/>The questions within.</p><small>KNOWLEDGE · CURIOSITY · OBSERVATION</small></div><div><p class="eyebrow">A life worth knowing</p><h2>Samanta<br/>Chandrasekhar</h2><p>An astronomer whose careful observations and self-made instruments became part of Odisha’s intellectual heritage.</p><div class="actions"><a class="text-link" href="/people/samanta-chandrasekhar/">Read the first entry ↗</a><span style="font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)">Editorial draft</span></div></div></div></section>
 <div class="wrap"><section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Notes from the collection</p><h2>Small beginnings. Deeper stories.</h2></div></div><div class="notes-grid">{[entries[0],entries[2],entries[4]].map(e=><article class="note-card"><p class="eyebrow">{e.category}</p><h3><a href={e.href}>{e.label}</a></h3><p>{e.dek}</p><a class="card-bottom" href={e.href}><span>Read the research note</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>)}</div></section>
 <section class="invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">An encyclopedia grows through people</p><h2>Your knowledge.<br/>Our shared story.</h2></div><div><p>A family photograph. A local name. A source we haven’t found. Help make this a richer, more thoughtful record of Odisha.</p><div class="actions"><a href="/contribute/" class="button">Find your way to contribute <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section><div class="border-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div></div>
</Shell>
